2 CONT
2 CONT Gun Bergman (28 October 1916 – 1 July 1971) was a Swedish translator, linguist, and journalist. Known for her translations from Slavic languages to Swedish, her greatest feat was her translation of Ivo Andrić's novel The Bridge on
2 CONC  the Drina in 1960. She was married to Swedish film director Ingmar Bergman from 1951 to 1959.
