1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Holm's name in Swedish records was Johan Holmstrom Gabrielsson. He assumed the name John Holmstrom upon immigration to the United States. His mail kept being mixed up with that of his oldest son, John Eric Hol
2 CONC mstrom. So, Johan changed his name to John Holm and let his son continue with the name John Holmstrom.  
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Gabriel HOLMSTRÖM JONSSON and Elisabet Margareta JOHANSDOTTER. Emigrated on 27 Jun 1888 from Stockholm, Sweden. 
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT I Sverige hette han Johan Holmstrom Gabrielsson. Bytte vid emigrationen namn till John Holm för att slippa förväxlas med sin John Holmström
2 CONT
2 CONT källor:
2 CONT * Bjurholms kyrkoarkiv, Födelse- och dopbok, SE/HLA/1010013/C/2 (1830-1848), bildid: C0033951_00126 https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/C0033951_00126 "Johan"
2 CONT * Bjurholms kyrkoarkiv, Husförhörslängder, SE/HLA/1010013/A I/4 (1841-1848), bildid: C0033936_00111, sida 94 https://sok.riksarkivet.se/bildvisning/C0033936_00111 "Johannes"
2 CONT * ...
