1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Clara was born in Sweden November 12, 1893.   She came to the USA in 1914 and married Ernest Albin Holmgren the same year after moving to Canada.
2 CONT  They lived a few miles east of Kinestino, Sask for a number of years before moving to Weekes  in 1929 where they homesteaded. Clare gave birth to 14 children.   She was predeceased by her husband on Nov 10, 1955 in Prince George 
2 CONC BC.and also 4 children:Leroy, Ernest , Wilmar and Edna(Bone). Clare passed away in the Porcupine Plain hospital on Christmas Eve, 1975.
